# TI Design System v2.1 (TIKG/AB/CEU)

Full machine-readable reference lives in `@design-system/` — load the relevant file before generating, then check output against `@design-system/qa-checklist.md`. **Context in → generate → checklist out.**

## Non-negotiables

- **Tokens only — never hardcoded hex/fonts/spacing/shadow/radius/motion.** Use `@design-system/tokens.scss` or `@design-system/tokens.css`. Literal colors require review.
- **Three typefaces only:** Merriweather (H1/H3/H4), Montserrat (H2/H5, buttons, nav), Open Sans (body).
- **Cards:** `border-radius: 0` + shadow `0 2px 24px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15)`.
- **Buttons:** Montserrat Bold 14px uppercase, letter-spacing 1px, min-width 150px, radius 4px; all five states (default/hover/focus 2px outline/active/disabled 40%).
- **Body text** = `#58595b` (never a brand color). **Purple = AI content only.**
- **Breakpoints** 768px / 1100px; max content width 1280px.
- **WCAG 2.1 AA mandatory:** 4.5:1 body / 3:1 large+UI; visible keyboard focus; semantic HTML; one H1; honor `prefers-reduced-motion`; `aria-label` on icon-only controls. Run axe/Lighthouse before accepting a component.
- **Voice:** see `@design-system/voice-and-content.md` — sentence-case UI labels, designation trademark format (CPCU®, ARM™), descriptive links (no "click here").
- **No AI-generated imagery** as TIKG visual assets.

Component specs: `@design-system/components.md`. Platform rules (web/PPT/email/LMS/webinar): `@design-system/platform-guides.md`. Authoritative web source: `web-develop.theinstitutes.org/themes/ti_west/public/style-guide/` (wins for web specifics).
